dmarked (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Migrate to Qt6 and DTK6
  * Update build system to use CMake
  * Replace deprecated Qt5 APIs (QRegExp → QRegularExpression)
  * Remove DTK version check conditional compilation
  * Add Qt6::Core5Compat for backward compatibility
  * Update all dependencies to Qt6 and DTK6 versions

